  "nodes": {
    "opening_read_room": {
      "node_id": "opening_read_room",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "希博公路酒馆的公开楼面被煤油灯照得发黄，吧台后方堆着湿杯子，木地板上有靴底带进来的泥水。地下酒吧的入口在楼梯口半掩着，下面传来短促的笑声和玻璃相碰声；每有人上楼，吧台旁的谈话都会停一瞬。露西站在水槽边擦杯子，袖口卷到手肘，指节被冷水泡得发白。她看见你靠近，先把杯子放回架上，又把抹布叠成一小块压在柜台边。你刚提到要找她，她的视线从你的嘴移到旁边两个散客，再落向靠窗角落。那里坐着一个穿深外套的男人，桌上摊着报纸，没有酒杯，也没有空盘。他翻页的动作很慢，椅子角度正对吧台；纸面挡住半张脸，露西转身取杯时，他的报纸边缘也跟着低了一点。\n\n「别在这儿说全名。吧台会把话传得比酒还快。」\n\n「你要问事，就挑能被旁人听见也没事的说法。」\n\n「靠窗那桌没点酒。他看报看了太久，我不喜欢他坐的位置。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_read_room_1",
          "text": "我不害你，只想避开耳朵。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_probe_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_read_room_2",
          "text": "我付酒钱，你只说闲话。",
          "target_node_id": "paid_discretion_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_read_room_3",
          "text": "我先看看屋里有谁。",
          "target_node_id": "watch_corner_first_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_read_room_4",
          "text": "你若瞒着，会被牵进去。",
          "target_node_id": "hard_pressure_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_probe_b1": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_probe_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把抹布搭在腕上，带你离开吧台两步，停在啤酒桶旁。窗边那男人翻了一页报纸，杯垫前仍是空的。\n\n「他在希博公路北侧有间旧测绘小屋。别在这儿念那个名字，听见的人会装作没听见。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_probe_b1_continue",
          "text": "小屋在哪？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_probe_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_probe_b2": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_probe_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西低头擦同一块木板，抹布来回压过水痕。楼梯口传来椅脚拖地声，她等那声音停下才开口。\n\n「不在主路旁。从酒馆后面那条土路绕过去，别从前门出去找。」\n\n「你走主路，别人也会知道你在找什么。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_probe_b2_continue",
          "text": "路标呢？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_probe_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_probe_b3": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_probe_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "她把一枚湿杯扣进架子，指尖在杯底停了一下。窗边的报纸降了半寸，又很快挡回脸前。\n\n「第七码碑。再往前，看见一根断了半截的电线杆，就别再沿大路走。」\n\n「他留了一只小铁盒在那屋里。拿走它，别把它带回这里问我。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_probe_b3_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_probe_b4",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_probe_b4": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_probe_b4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把抹布搭在腕上，绕到靠窗的窄桌边。角落男人翻了一页报纸，杯垫仍是干的；她没有看他，只把空杯往桌沿推近半寸。\n\n「那只小铁盒，我没打开过。」\n\n「我只要它离开这里，离开这间酒馆，别再有人拿它的事来问我。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_probe_b4_continue",
          "text": "东西怎么拿？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_probe_b5",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_probe_b5": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_probe_b5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "她低头擦桌面，抹布压过一道旧酒痕。窗外的雨水从檐角落进木桶，桶身靠着后墙，旁边堆着两只裂开的啤酒箱。\n\n「钥匙也许在雨桶底下。别在前门问，绕后面去。」\n\n「他最后一次来这里，手上沾着黑粉，洗了两遍，指甲缝里还有。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_probe_b5_continue",
          "text": "他还说什么？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_probe_b6",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_probe_b6": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_probe_b6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西停下手里的动作，把抹布折成四方，压在杯底下。角落男人的报纸边缘低了一点，又很快抬回原处。\n\n「他那晚只说了一句怪话：屋子外面只有二十步宽，里面量出来却多了四步。」\n\n「我不知道那是什么意思，也不想知道。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_probe_b6_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "end_soft_depart",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid_discretion_b1": {
      "node_id": "paid_discretion_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把湿抹布叠成方块，压在吧台内侧的杯垫上。窗边那张报纸翻了一页，纸声很轻。她没有朝角落看，只把一枚找零硬币推到你手边。\n\n「北边。」露西低声说，「希博公路北侧，有间旧测绘小屋。别在这里念他的名字。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_paid_discretion_b1_continue",
          "text": "小屋怎么走？",
          "target_node_id": "paid_discretion_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid_discretion_b2": {
      "node_id": "paid_discretion_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "她拿起空杯，转身放进水槽。水龙头开了一瞬，又立刻关上，像是在替一句话遮住尾音。她回到原处时，指尖在柜台边缘敲了两下。\n\n「不在主路旁。」她说，「从酒馆后方那条土路绕过去，别走前门外的大路。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_paid_discretion_b2_continue",
          "text": "有什么路标？",
          "target_node_id": "paid_discretion_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid_discretion_b3": {
      "node_id": "paid_discretion_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西从账本里抽出一张旧收据，把它折窄，推到盐罐旁边。收据背面没有字，只有她指甲按出的两道浅痕。\n\n「第七码碑，旁边有根断了半截的电线杆。」露西说。\n\n「他把一只小铁盒留在屋里。你拿走它，事情就跟我没关系。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_paid_discretion_b3_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "paid_discretion_b4",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid_discretion_b4": {
      "node_id": "paid_discretion_b4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把抹布搭在水龙头上，手指在湿布边缘按了两下。靠窗的报纸翻过一页，纸声很轻；她没有回头，只把声音压到杯盘碰撞里。\n\n「盒子里是什么，我不知道。你也别让我知道。」\n\n「这是交易条件：我只告诉你怎么拿走它，别把我说成知道内情的人。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_paid_discretion_b4_continue",
          "text": "条件可以。",
          "target_node_id": "paid_discretion_b5",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid_discretion_b5": {
      "node_id": "paid_discretion_b5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "她从抽屉里摸出一截断铅笔，在账单背面点了一个小圈，又立刻用手掌盖住。吧台另一端有人要酒，她等那人转身才继续开口。\n\n「那间屋子外头有只雨桶。钥匙也许在桶底下，也许已经不在。」\n\n「你听见的是‘也许’。这两个字对我很要紧。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_paid_discretion_b5_continue",
          "text": "还有路吗？",
          "target_node_id": "paid_discretion_b6",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid_discretion_b6": {
      "node_id": "paid_discretion_b6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把账单折成两折，推到空杯旁边。地下传来低低的脚步声，后门的铁闩被风顶了一下，发出短促的响。\n\n「别从正门出去。楼下后门通旧货运坡道，绕上去能避开窗边那双眼睛。」\n\n「走快点，别在坡道口停。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_paid_discretion_b6_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "end_paid_depart",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "watch_corner_first_b1": {
      "node_id": "watch_corner_first_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把抹布搭在啤酒桶边，侧身挡住吧台后的杯架。靠窗那人翻过一页报纸，杯垫仍是干的；他的视线越过纸沿，停在露西手上。\n\n“他不是这条路上的酒客。常客进门先看酒价，他进门先看我站哪儿。”\n\n“别回头看太久，他盯的不是你。”",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
